Question 6: Find All Unique Items Purchased

Scenario: 
A customer purchases several items, including repeated items. Write a Java program using a LinkedHashSet to display only unique items in the order they were purchased.




Solution:
import java.util.*;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        LinkedHashSet<String> items = new LinkedHashSet<>();

        items.add("Apple");
        items.add("Milk");
        items.add("Bread");
        items.add("Apple");
        items.add("Milk");
        items.add("Rice");

        System.out.println("Unique Items: " + items);
    }
}
